,"field","captureDate","label","截图采集","value","2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","The author-hosted game after recording the first clone.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/eight-second-crew-codex.webp","alt","A duck thief and its recorded clone in the opening museum, with key, guard sight cone and eight-second HUD.","https://sdj3261.github.io/openai_game_2026/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[88],"Codex","links","相关资源",[94],"resourceIds","section",{"_63":95,"_25":96},"OpenAI Codex","/zh/resources/codex/","创作者开发记录",[100],"evidence",{"_63":101,"_25":102,"_103":104},"查看人工与 Codex 的开发分工","https://github.com/sdj3261/openai_game_2026#codex와-함께-만든-과정","note","README and the creator’s linked article describe concrete planning, implementation, sprite, QA and deployment work; neither is a complete session transcript.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[109],{"_63":110,"_25":111,"_103":112},"查看完整游戏项目","https://github.com/sdj3261/openai_game_2026","Complete static project with modules, nine stages, sprites, fonts, tests and demo recording. Node.js 18+; npm start, with no dependency installation. Code has no explicit license; the bundled Galmuri font uses OFL.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[118],{"_63":119,"_25":76,"_103":120},"试玩 8-Second Crew","Korean, English and Japanese; keyboard, click-to-move and touch. WASD/arrows move, X records a clone, Z lures guards, and R restarts. Wait through the brief Ready countdown before moving.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","build log","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[128],{"_63":129,"_25":102,"_103":-7},"阅读作者的 Codex 开发记录","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[134,135,136,137],"Start the first stage and learn movement, keys and exits.","Read the creator’s Codex development account and asset credits.","Press X to record a route, then inspect how the clone replays it.","Change a stage or replay rule and test a complete escape and restart.","AI 工作流与开发背景","DongJae Shin 决定规则、难度和表现方向，Codex 协助规划与实现关卡、碰撞、行动重播、界面、测试和部署。Agent Sprite Forge 处理生成角色的精灵素材，作者反复试玩并提出修改。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","资产制作工具",false,[154],"assetTools","Agent Sprite Forge","引擎","Canvas 2D · Vanilla JavaScript · HTML/CSS UI","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",[134,135,136,137],{"_63":174,"_25":102,"_17":175},{"_63":173,"_25":76,"_17":114,"_103":120},{"_63":170,"_25":111,"_171":172,"_103":112},{"_63":169,"_25":102,"_103":104},[168],[154],"codex","Read the author’s human and Codex division of work","Open the complete game project","scope","complete-project","Play 8-Second Crew","Read the creator’s Codex build account","build-log",{"_177":178},"documents",{"_68":179,"_35":180},[182,186,187,188,185,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,184,221,183,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239],[181,182,183,184,185],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","skills/leve